{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hive has fallen. Armed with nothing but a pistol and a few brave bees, you must rebuild, survive, and fight back against a growing swarm of zombie insects. Can you turn this brutal attack into a thriving, safe home? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a wild blend of hive management, survival shooter, and pure bee chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1d <strong>Build and manage your hive</strong> \u2013 hatch new bees, name them, and grow your buzzing army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Lead armed bees into battle</strong> \u2013 equip your bees with AK-47s and other outrageous weapons hidden across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Explore exotic flowers, unique biomes, and discover rare types of honey</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Engage in strategic combat</strong> \u2013 take down zombie bugs with clever tactics and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Expand your hive</strong> \u2013 unlock powerful upgrades and defend your Queen at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Face the zombie outbreak</strong> \u2013 stop the mysterious fungal infection before it devours everything.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One by ONE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2927910/21451c7f5e02802d6f580d4ff7d6ed2ffa61e894.jpg"},{"name":"Sting Operation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2927910/47a1a0ea7dbecdb416a7ae859be7893c44c44ada.jpg"},{"name":"Pioneer of Pollination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2927910/83b2edd12d906a40ec14c459d459135cd401caae.jpg"},{"na